		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Purple-capped, human-sized fungus folk who thrive via spore infection. Prefer to take captives for inoculation.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 10, <strong>HP</strong> 10, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +1 (1d6 + inoculate) or charm spores, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Charm Spores</strong>. All non-fungi within near, CHA 9+ or charmed for 1d4 hours. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Inoculate</strong>. Spore disease. CON 9+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check each day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON, spawning 1d6 myceloids in 1d6 days.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
